  "_comment": "Outboard archetypes (19-inch rack units) for NAM captures of preamps, compressors and EQs. golem matches a capture's label to one by `match` and `aliases` (the longest keyword wins, as for amps and pedals); `kind` voices the unit (preamp, comp, eq); `look` is a period and a material, never a maker's livery; `u` is the height in rack units; `controls` are drawn left to right. A control with `bind` shows the capture's own setting, read from its label by GolemPedals.outboardSetting (gain in dB, hard, channel, ratio, program). The spring tank, the tape echo and the bucket-brigade echo are for golem's IR captures (ir-fx, drawn with format 'ir'): `program` is the unit's program display (style lcd, led or a stepped selector of `count` positions) showing the capture's program, `spring`, `tape` and `bbd` are the unit's window. Hand-written: tools/build-data.py copies it into visuals-data.js as archetypes.outboard.",
